  ('tag', 'Wide name measurement and linkage tag', 'attributes', 'A tag used in wide names to clarify relationship and linkage in the flattened, single table format.', ' If a column doesn’t have tag value at the end, then it means it applies to all groups, while one with a tag only applie to fields with the same tag value. For example, a value under qr_qualityFlag (with no tag) applies to fields in the group with tag == .odm10 and all other groups. If there’s a column called qr_qualityFlag.odm10, however, then the group with that .odm10 tag uses the value from qr_qualityFlag.odm10 instead of from qr_qualityFlag (like wat_sa_nr_hMe_hUn_hAg_NR_value.odm10 and mr_unit.odm10, for example).', 'NA', 'naDomain', 'naSpecimenSet', 'naCompartmentSet', 'naGroup', 'naClass', 'naNomenclature', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'naUnitSet', 'naAggrScale', 'naAggrSet', 'NA', 'genMissingnessSet', 'active', '3.0.0', '3.0.1', 'missed in the V3.0.0 release, added with details in the V3.0.1 release.', 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'NA', 'NA', NULL, 'header', 'optional', 31, 'NA', 'varchar', 'NA', 'NA', 0, 8),
