  ('engconfOn', 'eng', 'confOn', 'Number of confirmed Cases Onset date', 'Number of confirmed cases of a given disease, totaled by onset date.', 'Onset date is the earliest date that symptoms were reported for a confirmed case. This data is often not known and reported. In lieu, episode is used.', '1.0.0', '2.2.0', 'added in V2.2.0', NULL),
