  ('engdictionaryRefTableSet', 'eng', 'dictionaryRefTableSet', 'Dictionary reference table set', 'Reference or look-up tables.', 'For example, the parts table describe all elements of the ODM, including tables, table headers, measures, methods, categories, and units. sets are collections of parts. For example, units can be grouped together in a unitSet. languages and translations support translations.', '2.0.0', '2.0.0', 'added in V2.0.0', NULL),
