  ('enggroup', 'eng', 'group', 'Group', 'Unique identifier for a group of measures. Mostly applicable for measures, methods, units, and aggregations.', 'A collection of related measures. For example, SARS-CoV-2 is a group. Within the SARS-CoV-2 group, there are measure classes tht include RNA alleles (N1, N2, E, etc.), mutations, (E484K0), an entire sequence, viral proteins, etc. Currently groups are used for measures only.', '2.0.0', '2.0.0', 'added in V2.0.0', NULL),
